#: package.description
msgid ""
"MokkenLab brings every capability of the mokken package to jamovi and pairs "
"every result with evidence-based methodological guidance, interpretation and "
"educational support. It estimates scalability coefficients (Hij, Hi, H) with "
"standard errors, Wald-based or range-preserving confidence intervals and "
"significance tests, selects items into Mokken scales automatically (Mokken's "
"procedure or a genetic algorithm, at one or many lower bounds), checks "
"monotonicity, invariant item ordering, nonintersection (rest-score and "
"P-matrix methods) and local independence (conditional association), and "
"reports reliability (MS, alpha, lambda-2, LCRC), Guttman-error outliers, "
"bounds for dichotomous items, norm statistics with standard errors, and "
"two-level Mokken scale analysis for raters nested in subjects. Every "
"method-backed table cites its own source in jamovi's native numbered format, "
"and the complete APA 7th edition bibliography lives in the module's "
"documentation."
msgstr ""

